<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher Wednesday in active trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 577.87, up 4.25.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 298 to 206.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.10.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 20,649,230, compared with 18,043,820 Tuesday.</p>
<p>	 (Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
